WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:16.442
Tommy Brock and Red Fox chased each other.

2
00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:24.915
They ran all around the den.

3
00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:28.270
Flopsy hopped back to her hiding spot.

4
00:00:28.271 --> 00:00:32.102
Then Tommy ran out of the den.

5
00:00:32.103 --> 00:00:40.787
Red Fox chased him.

6
00:00:40.788 --> 00:00:46.245
The two animals ran into the woods.

7
00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:52.338
Flopsy flew out of her hiding spot.

8
00:00:52.339 --> 00:00:55.048
She hopped into the den.

9
00:00:55.049 --> 00:01:01.021
"Mopsy?" Flopsy called. "Cotton-tail?"

10
00:01:01.022 --> 00:01:04.934
"Help!" Mopsy cried.

11
00:01:04.935 --> 00:01:09.063
Cotton-tail banged hard on the oven door.

12
00:01:09.064 --> 00:01:15.032
"We're in here!" she said.

13
00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.979
Flopsy raced to the oven.

14
00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.011
She opened the door.

15
00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:33.123
"Flopsy!" her sisters cried.

16
00:01:33.124 --> 00:01:36.552
The rabbits ran outside.

17
00:01:36.553 --> 00:01:42.679
Tommy was still fighting with Red Fox.

18
00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:48.717
"Let's go home!" Flopsy said.

19
00:01:48.718 --> 00:01:57.415
The three bunnies hopped fast along the path.

20
00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:04.651
Soon they were home.

21
00:02:04.652 --> 00:02:07.874
"Thank you, Flopsy," Mopsy said.

22
00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:13.138
"You saved us!" Cotton-tail said.

23
00:02:13.139 --> 00:02:16.630
Flopsy frowned at her sisters.

24
00:02:16.631 --> 00:02:20.864
"Never sneak out again!" she said.

25
00:02:20.865 --> 00:02:24.967
"We won't," Mopsy and Cotton-tail said.

26
00:02:24.968 --> 00:02:29.061
"Good," Flopsy said.

27
00:02:29.062 --> 00:02:32.429
She picked up the dusters and smiled.

28
00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:58.365
"Now let's finish cleaning!"

